Swamp
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mold Demon
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
